{"title":"Dogwood blossom","slug":"Dogwood_blossom","pageid":4921,"revid":21120,"timestamp":"2026-03-07T23:34:48Z","lastEditor":"Sebadagamer","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The Dogwood Blossom is a flower found on the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dogwood/\">dogwood</a> tree. The flower is similar to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Sakura_Blossom/\">Sakura Blossom</a>'s flower, just like the tree is. The flower sells for 75 in raw, and 300$ jarred. The flower has nothing special to it, eccept blending in the tree. </p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Jarred\">Jarred</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Jarred</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> <figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Raw flower\">Raw flower</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Raw flower</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n\n</div>"}
